--- !u!114 &114010090785595442
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1893721009496742}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 596
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 不过拖明山师兄的福，那次猎魔大赛虽然凶险，但也只有我和他二人身受重伤，其他弟子的猎杀非常顺利，算得上是伤亡最小的一届了。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114859886481251771}
  AvatarIntID: 1
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
